      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "依頼自体は単純だ。とある場所にいる\nイノーという人物を殺すだけさ。\n気乗りしないなら何もしなければいい。\nだが、お前はやるさ。必ずな……",
        "official_en": "It's a simple request—kill someone named Inno at\nthe place I point you to. Don't want to? Then forget\nI said anything. But we both know you'll do it.",
        "real_en": null
      },
